Package: zukomplink
Title: Static-Archive Consumer Fixture for zukomp
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Pedro", "Baltazar", , "pedrobtz@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Not for release. Consumes zukomp exactly as zuxlsx will,
    through LinkingTo alone: miniz's header comes off the LinkingTo include
    path and inst/lib/libzukomp.a is linked statically by ./configure, so
    there is no Imports entry and no run-time dependency on zukomp. It
    exists so that a broken archive, a missing header or a configure that
    cannot find either is discovered here rather than downstream. Its
    sibling tools/zukomptest covers the other consumption mode, where a
    codec is registered through the C ABI table.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
LinkingTo: 
    zukomp
Suggests: 
    testthat (>= 3.2.0),
    withr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
